# Koleksi request API — Gateplus Content Management
#
# Cara pakai: buka file ini di VS Code dengan ekstensi "REST Client",
# atau salin isinya ke Postman/Insomnia. Jalankan request dari atas ke bawah.
#
# Alur cepat:
#   1. Jalankan "Login admin" dan salin token dari response.
#   2. Tempel token ke variabel @token di bawah.
#   3. Jalankan request create/update/delete.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@contentId = tempel-id-content-di-sini
@token = tempel-token-dari-request-login

### Health check — status server + koneksi database
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### List content (publik: hanya content published)
GET {{baseUrl}}/contents?page=1&limit=9

### List content dengan search judul dan filter genre
GET {{baseUrl}}/contents?search=neon&genre=Sci-Fi

### List sebagai admin (dengan token: draft ikut terlihat)
GET {{baseUrl}}/contents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List sebagai admin dengan filter status draft
GET {{baseUrl}}/contents?status=draft
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detail content (published)
GET {{baseUrl}}/contents/{{contentId}}

### Login admin (salin token dari response ke variabel @token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@gateplus.id",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Profil user yang sedang login
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create content — draft (published_at otomatis null)
POST {{baseUrl}}/contents
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Judul Content Baru",
  "description": "Deskripsi lengkap content baru untuk pengujian manual.",
  "genre": "Action",
  "thumbnail_url": "https://picsum.photos/seed/contoh-baru/800/450",
  "status": "draft",
  "published_at": null
}

### Create content — published (published_at wajib)
POST {{baseUrl}}/contents
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Content Langsung Publish",
  "description": "Content ini dibuat dengan status published dan tanggal publish.",
  "genre": "Drama",
  "thumbnail_url": "",
  "status": "published",
  "published_at": "2026-10-06"
}

### Update content (PUT, payload lengkap)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/contents/{{contentId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Judul Setelah Diubah",
  "description": "Deskripsi setelah diubah melalui endpoint PUT.",
  "genre": "Thriller",
  "thumbnail_url": "https://picsum.photos/seed/contoh-ubah/800/450",
  "status": "published",
  "published_at": "2026-10-05"
}

### Delete content
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/contents/{{contentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Contoh kasus error (semuanya mengembalikan format { success: false, message, errors? })
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 400 — body kosong (validasi per field)
POST {{baseUrl}}/contents
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{}

### 400 — status published tanpa published_at
POST {{baseUrl}}/contents
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Tanpa Tanggal",
  "description": "Contoh validasi published_at.",
  "genre": "Action",
  "status": "published"
}

### 400 — thumbnail URL tidak valid
POST {{baseUrl}}/contents
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Thumbnail Salah",
  "description": "Contoh validasi thumbnail URL.",
  "genre": "Action",
  "status": "draft",
  "thumbnail_url": "bukan-url"
}

### 400 — genre di luar daftar
GET {{baseUrl}}/contents?genre=GenreAneh

### 401 — mutasi tanpa token
POST {{baseUrl}}/contents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Tanpa Token",
  "description": "Contoh request tanpa autentikasi.",
  "genre": "Action",
  "status": "draft"
}

### 403 — filter draft tanpa token (draft tidak terbuka untuk publik)
GET {{baseUrl}}/contents?status=draft

### 404 — content tidak ditemukan
GET {{baseUrl}}/contents/000000000000000000000000

### 404 — detail draft untuk pengunjung anonim (draft disembunyikan)
GET {{baseUrl}}/contents/{{contentId}}
